OL,3,GNEWSAHospital project milestone 'a long
OL,4,Atime coming'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe construction of a #247m emergency
OL,7,Fdepartment has reached its full height
OL,8,Fin an "important milestone" for the
OL,9,Fproject.
OL,11,FThe six-storey facility will replace
OL,12,FDerriford Hospital's 50-year-old
OL,13,Femergency department and double current
OL,14,Fcapacity when it opens in spring 2029,
OL,15,Fsaid University Hospitals Plymouth NHS
OL,16,FTrust.
OL,18,FStuart Windsor, future hospital
OL,19,Fprogramme director, said the new
OL,20,Femergency department would "make a real
OL,21,Fdifference to patients across Plymouth,
OL,22,FDevon and Cornwall".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
