OL,3,GNEWSAHospital project milestone 'a long
OL,4,Atime coming'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's been a long time coming but over
OL,7,Fthe last 11 months we've gone from
OL,8,Fbreaking the ground to seeing the
OL,9,Fbuilding come out of the ground," he
OL,10,Fsaid.
